  ✓ Stage 2: check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Stage 3: perform clean proof reconstruction from source
  → Stage 4: audit adequacy and real-program pinning
  • Stage 5: inventory and review every semantics/proof rule
  • Stage 6: create and run a fresh non-vacuity mutation
  • Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
